# Chezmoi Exclude Patterns
# Files that should NOT be tracked in the dotfiles repo

# Neovim
**/lazy-lock.json
**/lazyvim.json
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/test.*

# Zsh
**/dot_zcompdump*
**/.zcompdump*
**/*.zwc
**/private_dot_zhistory
**/private_dot_zsh_history

# Zim framework (let it install itself)
**/dot_zim/

# Build artifacts
**/*.o
**/*.so
**/*.a

# IDE
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# OS-specific
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
